em><Name>ET</Name><Type>TIME</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ elapsed time ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>160</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>M</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>192</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>StartTime</Name><Type>TIME</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>224</BitOffs></SubItem><Properties><Property><Name>PouType</Name><Value>FunctionBlock</Value></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Tc2_SerialCom">SerialLineControlADS</Name><Comment><![CDATA[=====================================================================================================*
 * Serial line interface controller for background communication                                       *
 * supports Pc ComPorts or Virtual ComPorts at the local PC or any connected PC (via Ads)              *
 * where TwinCAT TcAdsSerialCommServer is started. Communication is handled over ADS via Server.       *
 * Communication between a TwinCAT TcAdsSerialCommServer and                                           *
 * PLC communication buffers (RxBuffer, TxBuffer).                                                     *
